{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246120/extras/87694f6ea7b0fa60e51f0084b3faa5d9.poster.avif?t=1761452578\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246120/extras/87694f6ea7b0fa60e51f0084b3faa5d9.webm?t=1761452578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246120/extras/87694f6ea7b0fa60e51f0084b3faa5d9.mp4?t=1761452578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The first chapter of Coralina is now available!</h2><br>You will control <strong>Cora</strong>, a Cinema student that finds herself in a traumatizing event out of nowhere, taking her to what's known as the <strong>Limbo</strong>, or land of <strong>oblivion</strong>. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246120/extras/632c191c23cbf1b2bcea2040351a426d.poster.avif?t=1761452578\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246120/extras/632c191c23cbf1b2bcea2040351a426d.webm?t=1761452578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246120/extras/632c191c23cbf1b2bcea2040351a426d.mp4?t=1761452578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In this land, you'll be accompanied by a crow, who claims to be a god of death, and you will help him to solve the mystery of why you are on limbo and why other <i>deaths</i> occurred, in a investigation through time and space, in labyrinths that connect oblivion to human emotions. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246120/extras/66dc3fc589e36e65dc1d71165ccef12c.poster.avif?t=1761452578\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246120/extras/66dc3fc589e36e65dc1d71165ccef12c.webm?t=1761452578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246120/extras/66dc3fc589e36e65dc1d71165ccef12c.mp4?t=1761452578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This is a <i>RETRO</i> RPG with an amazing mix of original soundtracks and many different art styles. Explore new paths through this harmony of ideas.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Book Eater","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2246120/4a093381c252762fa0adafda873179ba41963c02.jpg"},{"name":"The Dark Swordfighter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2246120/aad5b85d89f1c5feaaf856fb5d317346b7414d48.jpg"},{"name":"An unexpected friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2246120/05fc6d9838344d169a23ff6ca9feed2cb76cc28f.jpg"},{"name":"Venturing the labyrinth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2246120/3a2780bb845006f1af59afd9b33616965800a5d9.jpg"},{"name":"Stardust Oddity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2246120/0af12ff7b5a06cbfa72752e7df57f95be62ee18e.jpg"},{"name":"Art Gallery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2246120/d1de0ead13105b27b7329779801008ac1a034bc4.jpg"},{"name":"Mastercomputer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2246120/85894aea31414a595dbfe7f968b220bbe2c31872.jpg"},{"name":"Diagrams for the Departed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2246120/443e849c0499cc87af28ae9165d0d2015af63a43.jpg"},{"name":"Hello, Coralina!","path":"https://cdn.akamai